      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The basic principles of instrumental estimation acute and chronic pain syndrome are presented. Electromyography and restoration of H-reflex permit to estimate the pain and carry out dynamic control during therapeutic procedures for vertebrogenic pain syndrome. The methods mentioned are the components of complex approach to diagnosis of pain syndrome."},
